"""Recorder Engine — drives Microsoft Edge via Selenium + CDP (Section 5).

A recording session captures a full digital twin of one transaction:
pages, every interactable element on every page (whole-page crawl),
a multi-strategy locator repository, DOM before/after each action,
screenshots, workflow path, validation rules and (optionally) network
activity.

Recording is the ONLY manual step in the platform, and it happens once
per unique transaction.
"""
